@ahggg/dsh-side-chat README · DeepSeek Harness Desktop：In DeepSeek Harness Desktop `0.2.1-rc.2`, open the plugin installation dialog and enter the complete package spec:

```text
@ahggg/dsh-side-chat@1.0.3
```

Install it, then restart DeepSeek Harness Desktop. Use the Desktop app's plugin manager for Desktop installations; the CLI commands below target the Web profile.

@ahggg/dsh-side-chat README · Desktop：After upgrading Desktop to DSH `0.2.1-rc.2`, update or reinstall Side Chat through the app's plugin manager using this exact package spec, then restart the app:

```text
@ahggg/dsh-side-chat@1.0.3
```

@ahggg/dsh-side-chat README · Web：```powershell
dsh plugin --profile web remove @ahggg/dsh-side-chat
```

